# task-29-parity-100.log — RA multi-house + alliances

## Audit row
PARITY_AUDIT §5 houses row (cited by plan todo 29: game.rs:651 2-owner model, ai owner 1 at :676 — anchors shifted after todos 22–28 landed; live anchors: `Game::base` two-house vec at game.rs:1055–1060, `set_player_owner` inverse at :1298, `AiCommander::new(1)` at :1079).

## Change summary
1. **Alliance sets on House** (`house.rs`): `allies: u32` bitfield (mirror of original REDALERT/HOUSE.CPP `Allies` field, `Is_Ally` = `(1<<house) & Allies`), `make_ally`/`make_enemy`/`is_ally`, plus `ai_enabled` flag and `spawn_slot: Option<u8>` with `with_spawn_slot` builder.
2. **N houses** (`game.rs`): `Game::add_house(id, name, faction)` appends a house with the next spawn slot + DEFAULT_CREDITS and resizes `ra_low_power_announced`; `make_ally`/`make_enemy`/`are_allied`/`set_ai_enabled` on Game; 8-entry `HOUSE_COLORS` palette replacing the 2-way `owner_color` branch (owner % 8, no panic for any index).
3. **Alliance-aware targeting** (`game.rs`): `enemies_of(owner)` now filters out allied owners (units + structures); `threat_cells(owner)` skips allied units/structures; AI attack target selection skips allies. Original semantics per HOUSE.CPP Make_Ally/Is_Ally ("an allied house will not be considered a threat or potential target").
4. **Per-house AI**: `update_ai` iterates all houses with `ai_enabled`, skipping the player house; legacy `disable_ai()` sentinel (`ai.owner == usize::MAX`) still disables AI entirely (launcher human-vs-human path at main.rs:6268,6305 preserved). `set_ai_tempo`/`ai.owner` save line unchanged.
5. **Save format v3**: `housecount` line + per-house `allies`/`ai_enabled` on the `house` line. v1/v2 saves still load (alliances default none, AI on). RNG round-trip test updated to expect v3 (deliberate behavior change; coverage unchanged, 14 rng_determinism tests still pass).
6. **OOB house index**: `spawn_unit`/`spawn_structure` returned 0 for OOB owner (existing check verified by new test); `threat_cells`, `enemies_of`, `are_allied` return empty/false for OOB — no panic anywhere.

## NOT changed (per plan guardrails)
- `Game::new`/`new_with_seed` still build the 2-house 1v1 skirmish (base vec unchanged).
- Launcher HUD `house.first_queued()` path (main.rs:7598, `get().and_then()`) untouched and green.
- `GameCommand::Produce` / `queue_unit` UnitRole→FactoryType routing untouched.
- Single-player 2-house defaults unchanged (214 pre-existing RA lib tests green).

